   - Accepting this limitation and documenting it
   - Changing the barrel to contain exactly 4 potatoes so after eating 1, at least 3 remain (making min_count=3 a valid check that's different from the "open barrel" milestone's min_count=1)

2. **"craft to acacia_door" milestone**: The standard recipe produces 3 doors from 6 planks, so I set min_count=3.

3. **"open barrel" vs "eat potato"**: These two milestones currently have the same rule (inventory_has baked_potato min_count 1), which is problematic. They need differentiation. I recommend the scene be adjusted to put more potatoes in the barrel to allow a count-based distinction.

